{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してくださった皆さん、\n有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、大丈夫です。 井上は元気です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、地元のお友達１３人くらいと\n久々に再開して遊びました  ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にわたし、学校が大好きで、\nお友達みんなのことが大好きだったから、\n時々、切なくなったりするけど、\nやっぱり離れても、みんな繋がって\nいるんだなって実感しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強も吹奏楽もバンドも、なにもかも\nもう、みんなと一緒に高校生活を\n過ごすことは叶わないけれど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで良かったんだっていつか言えるように\n頑張ろうと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お別れのとき、クラッカー\nぱーんってして、サプライズで、\n色紙を渡してくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしのために、こんなにしてくれて\n本当に嬉しかった（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長文で、みんな、いっぱい\n書いてくれてて、\n一文字一文字読むたびに、涙が\nあふれて止まらなくて、全部読むの\n大変だったよ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬいぐるみも、鞄に\n付けてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろには「 さゆ  すき 」って文字。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生大切にする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京に向かう電車で、お互い\n見えなくなるまで、手を降りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、わたしはいい友達に\nかこまれて幸せ者です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと、もっと、頑張らなきゃなって\n思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はいよいよ、全国握手会！\n本当に楽しみです！精一杯頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sayunyanヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/9665491/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}